Package: ooattest
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: TPM ATTESTATION
 Attests system state and measured boot hashes using TPM2 hardware security chips.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
